htheum under a pediment, the frieze band high on the walls, windowless galleries lit from above under Shukhov's glass roofs; the front garden behind its railing (the museum's own building page). Turned 135 degrees so the portico faces north-west to Volkhonka, as the ground file shows. Guessed: the building's dimensions (about 90 by 64 m), the pediment (drawn low and full width over the colonnade), the roof layout. No photographs were available."}